This app bundles Google ML Kit Text Recognition (Chinese) for on-device OCR,
which is subject to the ML Kit Terms of Service.

This app bundles the PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec text recognition model from PaddleOCR
(Copyright PaddlePaddle Authors, Apache License 2.0), taken from
https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec_onnx at revision
ed152b8b495f84de93cda5709d768548a9127622 (app/src/main/assets/ppocr/rec.onnx,
SHA-256 da72dc72ca4dc220df0dfde68c1dedc31c58d3e76a25871122e5056227d50092; the
character dictionary dict.txt is extracted from the same repository's
inference.yml), and runs it with ONNX Runtime (Copyright Microsoft Corporation,
MIT License).
